{"id":"schrift","lemma":"Schrift","pos":"noun","rank":4110,"glosses":["writing, script","script (system of writing)","hand, handwriting (individual way of drawing characters)"],"ipa":"/ʃʁɪft/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/15/De-Schrift.oga/De-Schrift.oga.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Schrift","plural":"Schriften"},"formAudio":{"Schriften":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2d/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Schriften.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie hat eine schöne Schrift.","en":"She has beautiful handwriting.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"well, beautifully","l":"schön"},null]},{"text":"Es ist unmöglich, seine Schrift zu lesen.","en":"His writing is impossible to read.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"impossibly"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to read"}]},{"text":"Weißt du, wessen Schrift das ist?","en":"Do you know whose handwriting this is?","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"who","l":"wer"},null,{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Deine Schrift ist sehr unleserlich.","en":"Your writing is very illegible.","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Deine Schrift ist sehr leicht lesbar.","en":"Your handwriting is very easy to read.","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"light"},null]}]}